---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Cta from '../components/Cta.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="Dragos Iorga: senior tech lead, 15 years across web, mobile, APIs, cloud and QA, based in Bucharest.">
  <div class="container">
    <section class="prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>Hi, I'm Dragos.</h1>
      <p class="lead">A senior tech lead with 15 years of building software across the whole stack.</p>
      <p>I've worked on web and mobile apps, APIs and GraphQL, AWS infrastructure, CI/CD pipelines, test automation and QA. Today I
        lead engineering for a high-traffic US consumer platform with demanding compliance requirements.</p>
      <p>I believe AI has changed what one experienced engineer can deliver, provided the process is disciplined. That's why I
        work as a one-person studio: you get senior judgment end to end, without handoffs.</p>
      <p>I write about AI-era engineering, speak at conferences and mentor developers who are adapting to the new way of working.</p>
      <p class="muted">Based in Bucharest, Romania. I work with teams in Europe and the US.</p>
    </section>
    <Cta />
  </div>
</Base>
